# Local pnpm settings only (build-script approval for pnpm 10+). The image's
# install runs before "COPY . ." and never sees it anyway, while pnpm 9 reads
# any pnpm-workspace.yaml as a workspace definition and demands a "packages"
# field. Drop this line if the Dockerfile ever moves to pnpm 10+.
